-> Make a second trip. #line:ch2_box_overweight_02
    <<choose "second">>
    An extra hour on the BQE. Everything arrives in one piece. #line:ch2_box_overweight_03
-> Load it anyway. #line:ch2_box_overweight_04
    <<choose "overload">>
    A weigh station on the way. The ticket wipes out a week of profit. #line:ch2_box_overweight_05
