title: ch2_box_rush
---
A bakery's supplier van broke down. They need flour across Brooklyn by five a.m. and will pay triple. #line:ch2_box_rush_01
-> Take the night run. #line:ch2_box_rush_02
    <<choose "go">>
    Flour on time, croissants on time. The owner saves your number. #line:ch2_box_rush_03
-> Say no and sleep. #line:ch2_box_rush_04
    <<choose "sleep">>
    You sleep through it. Somebody else gets a new client. #line:ch2_box_rush_05
